                      (    forth6809.asm):02446                                   ; silently dropped back to interpret mode
                      (    forth6809.asm):02447                                   ; every time QUERY read a new line,
                      (    forth6809.asm):02448                                   ; regardless of whether ";" had actually
                      (    forth6809.asm):02449                                   ; been reached. A colon definition split
                      (    forth6809.asm):02450                                   ; across multiple lines would have every
