                      (    forth6809.asm):02453                                   ; stack effect, executed) instead of
                      (    forth6809.asm):02454                                   ; compiled - "TRUE" pushing TRUEV onto the
                      (    forth6809.asm):02455                                   ; data stack instead of being compiled,
                      (    forth6809.asm):02456                                   ; leaving a stray cell CSP would correctly
                      (    forth6809.asm):02457                                   ; catch as a mismatch at ";" (-22). Moved
                      (    forth6809.asm):02458                                   ; here rather than removed outright: QUIT is
                      (    forth6809.asm):02459                                   ; only re-entered on cold boot or an
                      (    forth6809.asm):02460                                   ; uncaught error routing back through ABORT
                      (    forth6809.asm):02461                                   ; (confirmed - ordinary successful lines
                      (    forth6809.asm):02462                                   ; loop back to QLOOP directly, never QUIT),
