                      (    forth6809.asm):02464                                   ; state exactly when ANS's own QUIT
                      (    forth6809.asm):02465                                   ; semantics call for it - just not on every
                      (    forth6809.asm):02466                                   ; single line of an otherwise-uninterrupted
                      (    forth6809.asm):02467                                   ; session. Confirmed via MAME debugger.
