                      (    forth6809.asm):06335                                   ; length variable), then LDD ,U (a PEEK, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):06336                                   ; a pop) into BOTH UEADDR and UEDST - so the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06337                                   ; real source length was misread as an
                      (    forth6809.asm):06338                                   ; address, the real source address was never
                      (    forth6809.asm):06339                                   ; popped at all, and the true destination
                      (    forth6809.asm):06340                                   ; address never reached UEDST. Correct
                      (    forth6809.asm):06341                                   ; ANS order is ( c-addr1 u1 c-addr2 -- ):
                      (    forth6809.asm):06342                                   ; c-addr2 (dest) is on top, popped first.
