FFDE BDF638           (    forth6809.asm):07634                  JSR   TYPE
FFE1 1CAF             (    forth6809.asm):07635                  ANDCC #$AF
FFE3 7EDF18           (    forth6809.asm):07636                  JMP   ABORT
                      (    forth6809.asm):07637         
FFE6 20207761726D     (    forth6809.asm):07638         WARMMSG: FCC   "  warm"
     0006             (    forth6809.asm):07639         WARMMSGL EQU   *-WARMMSG
